ge and the stadtholder -- and then there was a Turkish dance , and a Polonese dance , all very fine , but nothing to come up to the Pyrrhic touch , which was a great deal the most knowing , in boots and spurs -- damme , now , I ca n’t describe the thing to you , ‘ tis a cursed pity you were n’t there , damme . ”
